    <item>
      <title>At your funeral</title>
      <link>http://localhost:44883/at-your-funeral/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 May 2025 18:55:43 +0200</pubDate>
      <author>mail@juju.casa (Casa de JuJu)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:44883/at-your-funeral/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div&#xA;  &#xA;    class=&#34;flex px-4 py-3 rounded-md shadow bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900&#34;&#xA;  &#xA;  &gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;text-primary-400 pe-3 flex items-center&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;relative block icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 496 512&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M248,8C111.033,8,0,119.033,0,256S111.033,504,248,504,496,392.967,496,256,384.967,8,248,8ZM362.952,176.66c-3.732,39.215-19.881,134.378-28.1,178.3-3.476,18.584-10.322,24.816-16.948,25.425-14.4,1.326-25.338-9.517-39.287-18.661-21.827-14.308-34.158-23.215-55.346-37.177-24.485-16.135-8.612-25,5.342-39.5,3.652-3.793,67.107-61.51,68.335-66.746.153-.655.3-3.1-1.154-4.384s-3.59-.849-5.135-.5q-3.283.746-104.608,69.142-14.845,10.194-26.894,9.934c-8.855-.191-25.888-5.006-38.551-9.123-15.531-5.048-27.875-7.717-26.8-16.291q.84-6.7,18.45-13.7,108.446-47.248,144.628-62.3c68.872-28.647,83.183-33.623,92.511-33.789,2.052-.034,6.639.474,9.61,2.885a10.452,10.452,0,0,1,3.53,6.716A43.765,43.765,0,0,1,362.952,176.66Z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;span&#xA;    &#xA;      class=&#34;dark:text-neutral-300&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &gt;Original post available &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.me/mindsetmachine/2305&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At your funeral, friends and family will argue over who gets your belongings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;People will talk about the food and the venue.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your life will be summarized in 2-3 paragraphs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Conversations will shift from your life to their lives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your friends will drive away thinking about what’s next on their to-do list.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Some people won&amp;rsquo;t be able to make it because &amp;ldquo;something came up.&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And most of the people you know today won’t even be there.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’re gonna die.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;People will move on (in weeks not years).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do what you want.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:44883/at-your-funeral/featured-funeral.jpg" />
    </item>
    
